Package: regionalVehicleSurvival
Title: Regional Vehicle Survival and Used-Vehicle Migration Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arthur", "Yip", email = "arthur.yip@nrel.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Analysis code for NREL's regional (state-level) vehicle survival
    and used-vehicle migration (net imports/exports) work, using Experian
    Vehicles-in-Operation data. The pipeline and analysis live in
    survival.qmd. This DESCRIPTION lists package dependencies; use renv for
    a fully pinned, reproducible environment (renv::init(); renv::snapshot()).
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    tidyverse,
    readxl,
    patchwork,
    scales,
    geofacet,
    gganimate,
    gifski,
    plotly,
    htmlwidgets,
    htmltools,
    networkD3,
    leaflet,
    mapview,
    sf,
    tigris,
    RColorBrewer,
    skimr,
    here
Suggests:
    webshot2
